              <h3>Akshay</h3>
              <p class="member-fullname">Akshay Pradeep Kumar</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="study">MSc Computer Science</p>
          <p class="bio">Akshay studies for an MSc in Computer Science and enjoys running and travelling. He has recently started to love cooking, adding a new creative pursuit away from his studies. He sees AI as a way to help developers complete tasks faster and believes that people working with AI may reach new heights in technology. His outlook is that software engineering will increasingly reward creativity in deciding what to make, rather than coding alone.</p>
