          <p class="interests"><strong>Interests:</strong> AI, full-stack development, fitness, cooking, and competitive gaming.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact"><em>Fun fact: Sachin once spent three hours debugging a production issue caused by a misspelling of his own first name in a configuration string.</em></p>
