  <main>
    <section id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Meet the people</p>
          <h2 id="team-title">The team</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-intro">From systems thinking to full-stack experiments, our perspectives are shaped by the things we build, study, and do beyond the screen.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="member-grid">
        <article class="member-card">
          <div class="member-top">
            <img src="{{image:akshay.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Akshay" width="128" height="128">
            <div>
              <h3>Akshay</h3>
              <p class="member-fullname">Akshay Pradeep Kumar</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="study">MSc Computer Science</p>
          <p class="bio">Akshay studies for an MSc in Computer Science and enjoys running and travelling. He has recently started to love cooking, adding a new creative pursuit away from his studies. He sees AI as a way to help developers complete tasks faster and believes that people working with AI may reach new heights in technology. His outlook is that software engineering will increasingly reward creativity in deciding what to make, rather than coding alone.</p>
          <p class="interests"><strong>Interests:</strong> Running and travelling.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact"><em>Fun fact: Akshay has started to love cooking.</em></p>
          <p class="outlook"><strong>In 5–10 years:</strong> He expects software engineering to be more about creativity in what people build than coding alone.</p>
          <p class="hot-take">🔥 We're teaching machines to code so we can finally spend our time arguing about what to build.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <div class="member-top">
            <img src="{{image:awez.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Awez" width="128" height="128">
            <div>
              <h3>Awez</h3>
              <p class="member-fullname">Mohammed Awez</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="study">MSc Computer Science</p>
          <p class="bio">Mohammed Awez is studying for an MSc in Computer Science. Outside his studies, he enjoys video games and running, and he loves cooking. He sees AI as both a help and a challenge for engineers: it can take on many tasks, while also pushing people to keep learning and improving their skills. Looking ahead, he expects AI to write more code, leaving engineers with more time to decide what to build and a growing need to keep up with new technology.</p>
          <p class="interests"><strong>Interests:</strong> Video games and running.</p>
          <p class="fun-fact"><em>Fun fact: Awez loves cooking.</em></p>
          <p class="outlook"><strong>In 5–10 years:</strong> He expects AI to do more coding while engineers focus on what to build and keep learning.</p>
          <p class="hot-take">🔥 AI is making coding easier, but being a software engineer harder!</p>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <div class="member-top">
            <img src="{{image:leman.png}}" alt="Photo of Leman" width="128" height="128">
