            <p>As AI takes on boilerplate, setup, tests, and more routine coding, engineers can spend more time shaping systems and deciding what is worth building.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="future-point">
            <h3>Human judgment matters more</h3>
            <p>Clear specifications, creative problem framing, critical thinking, and good decisions will matter as much as the ability to produce code.</p>
          </article>
